<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: center">&nbsp;</P>



<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">As previously disclosed in the Form&nbsp;6-K filed
with the Securities And Exchange Commission on February 4, 2026, Big Tree Cloud Holdings Limited (the &ldquo;Company&rdquo;) held its
extraordinary general meeting (the &ldquo;Meeting&rdquo;) on January&nbsp;30, 2026. At the meeting, the shareholder of the Company approved
the share consolidation whereby every twenty (20) issued and unissued ordinary shares of a par value of US$0.0001 each in the share capital
of the Company be consolidated into one (1) ordinary share of a par value of US$0.002 each and following the share consolidation, the
share capital of the Company be changed to US$50,000 divided into 25,000,000 comprising 20,000,000 class A ordinary shares of par value
of US$0.002 each and 5,000,000 class B ordinary shares of par value of US$0.002 each.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">The change from ordinary shares of par value of
US$0.0001 each to Class&nbsp;A Ordinary Shares will be reflected with the Nasdaq Capital Market and in the marketplace at the open of
business on February 12, 2026, whereupon the Class&nbsp;A Ordinary Shares began trading. The Company&rsquo;s Class&nbsp;A Ordinary Shares
will continue to trade on the Nasdaq Capital Market under the symbol &ldquo;DSY&rdquo; and under the new CUSIP Number of G1263B132.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">On <FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">February
11, 2026</FONT>, the Company issued a press release titled &ldquo;Big Tree Cloud Holdings Limited Announces Implementation of Class A/B
Share Structure and 1-for-20 Share Consolidation.&rdquo; A copy of the press release is attached as Exhibit 99.1 and is incorporated herein
by reference.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"></P>

